# Docker Sandbox — workshop-app

This workspace is the **Next.js lab demo** synced into a [Docker Sandbox](https://docs.docker.com/ai/sandboxes/) microVM.

## Split with platform

| App | Role |
|-----|------|
| **workshop-app** (this repo) | Labs, learn, about, local UI — runs in sbx |
| **docker-sandbox-platform** | Register, login, profile, progress, admin, Q&A — [hosted on Zerops](https://nextjs-26f1-3000.prg1.zerops.app/) |

Auth and Supabase live on the **platform**, not here. Use `redirectToPlatform()` / `platformUrl()` from `src/lib/platform.ts` for account flows.

## sbx quick reference

```bash
sbx ls
sbx run --clone cursor . --name feature/demo
sbx policy deny network "host"
sbx secret set -g anthropic
sbx rm NAME
```

## Security

- Never commit API keys or `.env.local`
- Use `sbx secret set -g anthropic` on the host
- Do not disable network deny rules in lab examples

Docs: https://docs.docker.com/ai/sandboxes/
